# KF-S0-INFRA-005 — Sprint 0 Guide 8: lint-staged, then typecheck.
#
# Everything runs through pnpm on purpose (KF-S0-INFRA-004, risk R-8).
# Turbo spawns `pnpm run <task>` per package; launched outside pnpm those
# children re-resolve the pinned pnpm@9.15.9 from the registry, which turned a
# 3s run into a 1m11s failure. Never call `npx turbo` or a bare turbo binary here.
pnpm exec lint-staged

# Typecheck the whole workspace (KF-S0-INFRA-004 decision D-12). Turbo's cache
# makes this near-instant when nothing relevant changed. Per-package filtering
# by staged path is a deliberate deferred optimization.
pnpm typecheck
